version: "1"
decissions:
    -
      id: core-001
      name: magic strings should be avoided
      reasoning: |
        A string is quickly miss spelled and it has no auto completion.ß
        Use enums where possible to make the code more readable and less error-prone.
    -
      id: core-002
      name: all data types base and advanced should be available in the `grimmcraft-data` package
      reasoning: |
        Have access to the full game data.
